#!/usr/bin/env -S uv run --script
# /// script
# requires-python = ">=3.11"
# dependencies = ["huggingface_hub>=0.34", "PyYAML>=6.0"]
# ///
"""hfarchive: archive a YAML-defined set of Hugging Face models onto a drive.

Transfers are delegated to the official `hf download` CLI (resume, integrity
checks, Xet). This script adds the layer around it: the config, profiles,
size accounting, safety guards and an append-only manifest on the drive.
"""

